1. Unofficial tool
   This software is an unofficial, fan-made tool. It is not affiliated with,
   endorsed, sponsored, or approved by Digital Extremes Ltd. Please do not
   contact Digital Extremes Ltd. about this software.

2. Trademarks and copyrights
   Warframe and all related names, logos, images, and in-game data are
   trademarks or copyrighted works of Digital Extremes Ltd. The MIT License
