   not to any such third-party rights.

3. Third-party assets and data
   This software does not bundle the official Fan Kit logos or any game data
   (drop tables, Public Export, Riven statistics, etc.). They are downloaded by
   the user from their respective providers. All rights to them remain with
   those providers, and their use is subject to the providers' terms. Do not
   redistribute them together with this software.

4. No warranty
   This software is provided free of charge and "AS IS", without warranty of
   any kind as to accuracy, completeness, usefulness, fitness for a particular
   purpose, or non-infringement. Drop rates, sources, prices, and other
   information shown may be incorrect or outdated.

5. Limitation of liability
   To the maximum extent permitted by law, the author shall not be liable for
   any damage arising from the use of, or inability to use, this software,
   including but not limited to data loss, actions taken against your game
   account, computer malfunctions, or disputes with third parties.

6. Game terms
   Digital Extremes Ltd. states that third-party software used with the game
   is used at your own risk. This software does not modify or read game files
   or memory and does not automate gameplay, but you use it at your own
   discretion and risk, after reviewing the game's EULA and Terms of Use.

7. Changes and discontinuation
   The author may change this software or stop distributing it at any time
   without notice. Some or all features may stop working due to changes made
   by data providers.
